{"availability":"available","full":"microsoft/Ontology-Playground","name":"Ontology-Playground","description":"Free, open-source web app for learning about ontologies and Microsoft Fabric IQ. Explore a catalogue of pre-built ontologies, design your own visually, export as RDF/XML, and share interactive diagrams. Zero backend, fully static.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":2833,"forks":363,"created":"2026-02-17T12:34:14Z","updated":"2026-09-17T18:51:55Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://microsoft.github.io/Ontology-Playground/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.563Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.563Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.563Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.563Z","stars":2833,"forks":363}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Try it live → microsoft.github.io/Ontology-Playground","A free, open-source web application for learning about ontologies and Microsoft Fabric IQ. Explore pre-built ontologies, design your own in a visual editor, export as RDF/XML, and share interactive diagrams — all from a fully static site with zero backend dependencies."],"features":["Cytoscape.js-powered graph that renders any ontology as an interactive node-and-edge diagram. Pan, zoom, click nodes to inspect properties, and use the live search bar to filter entities and relationships.","A curated library of official and community-contributed ontologies spanning six domains (Retail, E-Commerce, Healthcare, Finance, Manufacturing, Education). Browse by category, search by name or tags, load any ontology…","A full-screen, split-pane editor for creating ontologies from scratch or editing existing ones. Add entity types with icons, colors, and typed properties; define relationships with cardinalities; see a live graph…","Full round-trip support for RDF/XML (OWL classes, datatype properties, object properties with cardinalities). Import .rdf / .owl files, export in the exact format Microsoft Fabric IQ expects, and verify fidelity with…","Sign in with GitHub (device flow) and submit your ontology to the community catalogue directly from the designer — the app forks the repo, creates a branch, commits the RDF + metadata, and opens a pull request…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/microsoft/Ontology-Playground/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d1680a3549b18b8ee40a463e5df62bb9b933fe40780b6007655fa480f884cfa5","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.633Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.633Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Try it live → microsoft.github.io/Ontology-Playground","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/microsoft/Ontology-Playground/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign in with GitHub (device flow) and submit your ontology to the community catalogue directly from the designer — the app forks the repo, creates a branch, commits the RDF + metadata, and opens a pull request automatically.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/microsoft/Ontology-Playground/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d1680a3549b18b8ee40a463e5df62bb9b933fe40780b6007655fa480f884cfa5","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/microsoft/Ontology-Playground/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.634Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-17T18:51:55Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/microsoft/Ontology-Playground/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:08.635Z","hash":"d1680a3549b18b8ee40a463e5df62bb9b933fe40780b6007655fa480f884cfa5","originalBytes":13123,"storedBytes":13123,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["ontology","github","catalogue","docs","rdf","designer","guide","build","microsoft","school","azure","learning","npm","export","fabric","interactive","learn","pages","playground","vite","web","workflow","app","content","entities","graph","how","import","live","official